# Render outputs; the source is everything else. This example commits its review sheets (board.png and
# contact.png) so they show without a render, and leaves out vo.wav: node tools/cues.mjs makes it from take-raw.wav.
out/
stills/
board.md
brand.png
vo.wav
node_modules/

# Secrets: an --env-file kept in the piece (API keys) must never be committed.
.env
*.env
.env.*
